1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:57,960
Your injury…

4
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,080
I leave everything else to you.

5
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,760
Rest assured, My Lord.

6
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,360
I will take good care of Madam.

7
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:13,560
Bath water will be ready shortly.

8
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:16,120
Please have some ginger soup
to ward off the cold first, Madam.

9
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,920
Bitao was also frightened.

10
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,960
I wonder if she was hurt.

11
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,520
I know.

12
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:26,120
I had her check the wounds,
bathe, and change her clothes.

13
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,880
Once she gets cleaned up,

14
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,800
I will have her come see you.

15
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:37,160
My Lord has important
matters to attend to tonight?

16
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,000
Well…

17
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,640
I shouldn't have pried.

18
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,560
How is she?

19
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,080
Let's talk business.

20
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,040
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

21
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:50,960
Just as you expected,

22
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:53,320
sending assassins was merely a distraction

23
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:55,080
meant to stall us on purpose.

24
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:57,320
Those assassins
were hired with heavy bribes

25
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,800
through multiple intermediaries,

26
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:01,800
and none of them know who is behind it.

27
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,480
My Lord,

28
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,480
Zhuang Qi, the servant responsible
for sweeping Songyue Hall tonight,

29
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,560
took advantage of
the absence of the master and attendants

30
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:11,760
to sneak into the study to steal.

31
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:15,560
The study was left unguarded,
allowing him to snatch the secret letter.

32
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,480
He is now heading toward Guangji Street.

33
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:23,000
This is a good chance to see
who the master of this rat really is.

34
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:28,480
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

35
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:34,520
HAN LIAO, HEIR TO THE MARQUIS OF XITING

36
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:37,760
Sir. Please take a look, sir.

37
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,800
Lu Zhuo was cautious. The secret letter
was hidden under the floor tile.

38
00:03:40,880 --> 00:03:43,000
I managed to steal it
while he was off guard

39
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:45,000
and rushed to present it to you.

40
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:48,480
I planted you as a pawn six years ago,

41
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:51,560
yet you couldn't even
enter Songyue Hall's Study.

42
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:58,680
Today you finally proved useful.

43
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,800
Yes, sir.

44
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,680
See for yourself what this is.

45
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,880
<i>"Traitorous servant,</i>
<i>you are fed by your lord,</i>

46
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:23,000
<i>- so you should be loyal to him."</i>
- He…

47
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,880
<i>"How could you collude</i>
<i>with foreigners and invite disaster?"</i>

48
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:28,160
<i>"Your treachery is unforgivable."</i>

49
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,840
<i>"Wash your neck,</i>

50
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,840
<i>for I shall take your wretched head."</i>

51
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,880
Sir.

52
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:35,720
Spare my life, sir.

53
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:38,400
Sir, I… I didn't know that inside…

54
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,920
- This is…
- Sir,

55
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,160
Lu Zhuo led a crowd
and surrounded the main gate.

56
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,160
Lu Zhuo?

57
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:46,240
Sir. Spare my life, sir.

58
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:48,840
- I knew nothing…
- Fool!

59
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:50,960
We fell into his trap.

60
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:08,120
It is already past midnight.

61
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:10,920
May I ask what brings you here

62
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,640
at such an hour, Lord Lu?

63
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,600
Pardon my intrusion, Lord Han.

64
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:19,080
A servant in my residence
stole a treasure and fled.

65
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:22,000
Many witnesses saw
him escape into your manor.

66
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:24,480
Please accommodate me

67
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,400
and allow me
to catch this audacious thief.

68
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:32,120
Lord Lu, you are making it clear

69
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:34,280
that you want to search my residence.

70
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:39,040
What if I insist on refusing?

71
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:42,600
The stolen item is a jade-hilted dagger
bestowed by the late Emperor.

72
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,360
The thief is guilty of high treason.

73
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:48,480
Harboring him
will be punished as equal treason.

74
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,040
Lord Han, you have always been prudent.

75
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,120
You wouldn't be so foolish, would you?

76
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:02,480
Lord Lu, this way, please.

77
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,280
What is happening?

78
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,680
Pull them apart quickly.

79
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,560
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING FILMING

80
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,680
FILMED UNDER
PROFESSIONAL SUPERVISION WITHOUT HARM

81
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,080
Could this be the thief

82
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,640
you were looking for, Lord Lu?

83
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:59,920
I keep about
twenty fierce hounds in this manor.

84
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:02,160
Unluckily for this blind thief,

85
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:04,880
he barged right in
and became their midnight meal.

86
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,040
I'm afraid you came for nothing, Lord Lu.

87
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,320
Come help

88
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:15,160
check if this thief
has any valuables on him.

89
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,280
Zhao Song.

90
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,680
Lord Han, what fine dogs you've raised.

91
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:40,000
Not a single survivor was left.

92
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:42,720
My hounds have always fed on raw meat.

93
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:46,280
Their ferocity
is no less than that of wild wolves.

94
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:52,480
Why don't I send extra men to help you
thoroughly search along the way

95
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:55,360
to see where he'd drop the treasure?

96
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,480
It couldn't have vanished
into thin air, right?

97
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:02,600
It is getting late.
No need to trouble yourself, Lord Han.

98
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,600
I shall handle it myself.

99
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,960
Until we meet again.

100
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:15,480
Let's go.

101
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,520
Take good care, Lord Lu.

102
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:24,080
Forgive me for not seeing you off.

103
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:27,000
Thanks to your clever scheme, Master,

104
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:28,560
that Lu guy

105
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,960
- found no witnesses.
- Peak stupidity!

106
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,400
Since he's certain it was me,

107
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:36,120
this deadly feud is already sealed.

108
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,960
Why would he still need witnesses?

109
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,480
You are right, Master.

110
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:44,200
Sir, I still have a great secret to tell.

111
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,280
I snuck into the Study twice.

112
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,840
The first time,
I didn't find the secret letter,

113
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:50,160
but under the pillow,
I found a square handkerchief.

114
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,840
Fearing I'd alert him,

115
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:52,760
I didn't dare take it.

116
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,680
I stuffed it back, sir.

117
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:59,120
What secret could save your life?

118
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:03,680
How laughable that Lu Zhuo
came to pick a fight with me,

119
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:07,040
totally unaware of
the crisis brewing at home.

120
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:12,480
Perhaps his fake wife
could still be of use to me.

121
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:16,440
XIANZHUANG

122
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:18,160
Maternal Grandmother!

123
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,920
Maternal Grandmother!

124
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:24,520
It's me, Rao. Maternal Grandmother!

125
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:26,880
- Do you know whose residence this is?
- Grandmother.

126
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,120
How dare you cause
a disturbance at midnight?

127
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,160
HUO JUE, ELDEST SON OF THE HUO FAMILY

128
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,320
Rao.

129
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:56,400
If Lu Zhuo knew the wife he married

130
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:59,760
was a filthy, vile,
and foul night-soil woman,

131
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,480
he would be disgusted to death.

132
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,240
Come, drink this ginger soup.

133
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,760
Grandmother is
cold-hearted and ignores me.

134
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:27,040
Only Maternal Grandmother
can stand up for me.

135
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:29,960
Call her here. Call her here!

136
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:31,200
Maternal Grandmother
went back to honor our ancestors.

137
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:33,520
My father and mother accompanied her.

138
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:36,360
The round trip will take at least a month.

139
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,920
I fear that before she returns,

140
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,240
I'll be hounded to death
by the evil woman!

141
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,200
All of you, dismiss.

142
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:58,520
She stole my place
and made the lie reality.

143
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:00,760
I have no way out left.

144
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:03,160
What should I do?

145
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:08,080
I've traveled far and wide for business
and dealt with thousands of impostors.

146
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,920
No need to disturb Grandmother.

147
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,200
Leave everything to me.

148
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:14,400
I will avenge your grievance.

149
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,480
Really?

150
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:32,200
Rest assured.

151
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,760
First, tell me.

152
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,520
What exactly is the woman's background?

153
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,680
What's wrong, My Lady?

154
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:05,440
My Lady, what are you…

155
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,640
Go to the kitchen
and quietly catch a chicken.

156
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:11,160
- Hurry.
- Alright.

157
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:28,640
My Lady, what are you doing?

158
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:40,040
The rooster crows thrice as day breaks.

159
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,040
The first crow is at the third watch.

160
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:44,360
The third crow is at the fifth watch.

161
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,040
There isn't much time left.

162
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,360
Before broad daylight,

163
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:51,440
we must find a reliable person
to send this bundle to a certain place.

164
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,040
My godmother's family is also
among the Wei family's dowry servants.

165
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:56,920
My godbrother, Liangcai,
grew up on my back

166
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,320
and listens to me the most.

167
00:12:58,400 --> 00:12:59,800
Rest assured, you can rely on him.

168
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,200
Who is it?

169
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:28,560
What's this?

170
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:30,480
How did this end up here?

171
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:32,680
- What is it?
- What's in there?

172
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,120
- Quick.
- What is it?

173
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:42,920
Oh my, it's gold!

174
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:44,040
- Yes, it's gold.
- Shh.

175
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,520
- Quiet.
- It's gold.

176
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,120
Keep quiet.

177
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:48,720
Heaven has finally shown mercy

178
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:50,520
- and sent food to us poor folk.
- So much gold.

179
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,440
There's blood on the wrapping.

180
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:55,760
Some bandit must have stolen
treasures from a rich family

181
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:57,720
and thrown this thing in here
in panic while being chased.

182
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,280
The bandit will
surely return for it later,

183
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:03,080
and he'll silence us.

184
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:04,160
- That's right.
- We can't take it.

185
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,520
Even if the bandit doesn't return,

186
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:08,000
it will still bring legal trouble.

187
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:10,080
We must not do this.
We absolutely must not.

188
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:11,320
What should we do?

189
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:15,840
Listen to me.
We'll take the gold and scatter

190
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:17,720
so they have
no way to trace it back to us.

191
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,560
- Don't fight over it.
- It's mine.

192
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:25,080
It's mine.

193
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:26,680
Don't fight over it!

194
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:34,200
Search.

195
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:46,320
My Lord, they left in a hurry.

196
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:48,520
They even looted the chicken coop
and left nothing behind.

197
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,680
We're a step too late. Let's go.

198
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:07,320
Oh no. Why are they back again?

199
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:16,920
I almost forgot about you.

200
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:22,200
What are you doing? I did nothing wrong.

201
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,800
Why are you arresting people blindly?

202
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:26,320
Gently. Be gentle.

203
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:30,000
Liangcai said two groups went there.

204
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:32,760
He recognized the first group.
They were from the Huo family.

205
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:36,040
Lady Rao's birth mother was
the second daughter of the Zhou family.

206
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:39,880
Lady Shou'an also had an eldest daughter
who was miswed in her first marriage

207
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,880
and remarried into the wealthy Huo family.

208
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:45,040
Huo Jue is the eldest young master
of the Huo Residence.

209
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:48,680
So, he is considered
Lady Rao's first cousin.

210
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,560
What about the other group?

211
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:56,680
Liangcai quietly followed them
and found that those people took Madam Liu

212
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:58,440
to the back gate of
the Marquis of Xiting's Residence.

213
00:15:58,520 --> 00:16:00,360
He asked around through connections

214
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:02,360
and learned
that Madam Liu sold fake pearl strings

215
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,720
and offended
the Old Marquis's favorite concubine.

216
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:06,760
It has nothing to do with you.

217
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,320
Marquis of Xiting's Residence…

218
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:14,120
Governess Miao said last night
that Lu Zhuo had business to attend to,

219
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:17,160
and Guanzhu said
they were catching a spy in the residence.

220
00:16:17,760 --> 00:16:19,200
We can't worry about so much now.

221
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,760
The banquet is what's important right now.

222
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:21,800
Come.

223
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:29,280
When taking the cup,
reaching out too far ruins your grace.

224
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,080
Pull back a bit.

225
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:39,320
Lady Rao excels
at playing the <i>se</i> and <i>sheng,</i>

226
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:42,600
pity that the Dowager Lady
scolded song and dance as frivolous

227
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,160
and wouldn't let her indulge in them.

228
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:47,400
In fact, Lady Rao's birth mother back then

229
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:49,520
was also a grace-filled beauty
of a dancer.

230
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,560
Spy…

231
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:54,360
Marquis of Xiting's Residence…

232
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,680
The tenement…

233
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:03,040
Bitao, tell me in detail again

234
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:05,160
about the background of
the Marquis of Xiting's Residence

235
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,839
and its connection to
the Duke's Residence.

236
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:10,119
I heard Han Liao, the heir
to the Marquis of Xiting,

237
00:17:10,839 --> 00:17:12,760
is Lord Lu's sworn enemy.

238
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:17,160
Madam, His Lordship is here.

239
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,240
My Lord.

240
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,200
Open the door.

241
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:31,760
I caught a cold from
falling into the water last night,

242
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:34,400
and I just took my medicine and lay down.

243
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:35,320
You were frightened
after falling into the water.

244
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:37,320
If I ignore it, Grandmother will blame me.

245
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:39,840
I'll leave once I see you're fine.
Open the door.

246
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,960
I'm too ill and lazy to dress up,

247
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:44,040
and I do not wish to see anyone.

248
00:17:45,080 --> 00:17:46,480
Please forgive me, My Lord.

249
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:54,080
Rest well, then.

250
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:57,720
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

251
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,880
Why didn't you see
His Lordship, Young Lady?

252
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,600
If I yield to him in everything,

253
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:09,680
he will look down on me even more.

254
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:11,000
Besides,

255
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:13,360
I have more important things to do
and can't be bothered with him.

256
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:30,160
"A young girl"…

257
00:18:30,920 --> 00:18:32,800
I can't read the last character properly.

258
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:36,360
I never even noticed
there were characters here.

259
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,560
"A young girl"

260
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,880
refers to girls under six chi tall.

261
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,600
Most of them started working

262
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:47,360
in public or private workshops
from the age of six,

263
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,760
quietly carving their names
on inconspicuous cup bottoms,

264
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:55,440
foolishly hoping to be
like experienced artisans,

265
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:57,480
making a name for themselves
to support their families.

266
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,760
It was nothing but wishful thinking.

267
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:07,360
How could the nobility ever notice
such an insignificant gesture?

268
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:14,560
Bitao,

269
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:17,720
dangers lurk everywhere now,

270
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:20,560
and everyone wants my life.

271
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:22,600
To keep myself safe,

272
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,280
I must find a way

273
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:29,360
to make all of the capital know who I am

274
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:34,520
and recognize me alone.

275
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:40,920
What?

276
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,840
You want to organize
Mother's birthday banquet?

277
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:45,320
That won't do.

278
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,440
Why not?

279
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:50,840
This is a gesture of filial piety
from my granddaughter-in-law.

280
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:52,520
Why wouldn't it be fine?

281
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,240
What she means is,

282
00:19:57,040 --> 00:20:00,080
hosting a birthday banquet with
many guests, where noble families gather,

283
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:02,320
is not something to be taken lightly.

284
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:03,760
In past years,

285
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,760
my sister-in-law
and I organized it together,

286
00:20:05,840 --> 00:20:08,200
and we barely managed
without making a misstep.

287
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:11,320
This year, the Duke specifically sent word

288
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:15,400
that it must be grand, festive,
lively, and respectable.

289
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:19,640
Rao has only just married in.

290
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:20,840
She is young and easily overwhelmed.

291
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:23,680
If anything is overlooked or mismanaged,

292
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,760
and she fails to hold her ground,

293
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:28,880
and the gossips outside start talking,

294
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:31,000
won't that hurt
her sincere filial intentions?

295
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:32,080
Exactly.

296
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:38,320
Rao, you're young and inexperienced.

297
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,480
If a birthday celebration like this
turns into a laughingstock,

298
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:42,440
it's no child's play.

299
00:20:44,160 --> 00:20:45,720
You should gain experience
for a couple more years

300
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:47,120
before taking charge.

301
00:20:48,520 --> 00:20:50,080
I know you are being
considerate of me, Mother,

302
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:53,040
but when the Lu Residence
closed its doors before,

303
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:54,800
a lot of groundless gossip
started circulating outside.

304
00:20:55,800 --> 00:20:57,600
Some say my husband is gravely injured

305
00:20:58,600 --> 00:21:00,480
and that the Lu family
will decline from now on.

306
00:21:01,840 --> 00:21:04,960
Some say that I, the new bride, am hideous
and don't dare meet the guests.

307
00:21:05,040 --> 00:21:07,160
- This…
- And those with ulterior motives

308
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,280
fabricated rumors,

309
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:10,240
claiming my husband
failed at the front lines

310
00:21:10,320 --> 00:21:11,640
and lost His Majesty's favor.

311
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:13,280
All sorts of unbearable rumors…

312
00:21:13,360 --> 00:21:15,640
That is precisely why the Duke
wants a grand celebration.

313
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:19,040
Is that really true?

314
00:21:19,120 --> 00:21:20,920
These rumors have even reached my ears.

315
00:21:21,520 --> 00:21:23,360
So I also agree that Rao
should step up and make an appearance.

316
00:21:24,040 --> 00:21:25,280
Host the birthday according to tradition,

317
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:27,280
with her two sisters-in-law guiding her,

318
00:21:27,360 --> 00:21:29,600
and take this opportunity
to let her meet the guests

319
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:31,480
to put an end to those outrageous rumors.

320
00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:36,160
- But…
- What "but"?

321
00:21:36,240 --> 00:21:37,760
You are an elder.

322
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:41,720
When asked to guide her,
you're still making excuses here.

323
00:21:41,800 --> 00:21:43,760
- Mother…
- Shut up.

324
00:21:46,080 --> 00:21:48,480
Listening to Mother in everything
can never go wrong.

325
00:21:48,560 --> 00:21:49,720
I…

326
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:53,120
Rao, then

327
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,920
we'll do as you say.

328
00:21:57,040 --> 00:22:00,240
You really are too impetuous.

329
00:22:00,320 --> 00:22:03,600
How could you know the difficulties
of organizing a birthday banquet?

330
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:07,960
Back when I first married into the family,

331
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:10,680
I was also naive and arrogant.

332
00:22:11,200 --> 00:22:13,680
I suffered so many schemes behind my back.

333
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:17,080
Words can't describe those hardships.

334
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,720
Wanniang. Rao.

335
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:19,760
Fourth Aunt.

336
00:22:21,520 --> 00:22:23,880
What was the procedure for
Grandmother's birthday in previous years?

337
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:26,720
I still need to consult you,
Mother and Fourth Aunt.

338
00:22:26,800 --> 00:22:28,240
Those are just outdated routines

339
00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:29,840
and unwritten traditions.

340
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:31,840
The hard part is bringing new ideas to it.

341
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:33,960
Let's talk as we walk.

342
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:37,720
Come.

343
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:44,880
Come.

344
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:50,880
I thought she was easy to handle,
never expecting she would silently

345
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:52,960
steal the spotlight
from hosting the banquet.

346
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:56,440
The Wei family produced a vixen long ago.

347
00:22:56,520 --> 00:22:58,640
They were never a respectable home.

348
00:22:58,720 --> 00:23:00,400
The Dowager Lady just wouldn't listen.

349
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:03,560
Sooner or later, she will stir up
trouble and disgrace our family name.

350
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:06,000
Why get angry at a young lady?

351
00:23:06,520 --> 00:23:07,440
Her mother-in-law

352
00:23:07,520 --> 00:23:09,280
became a laughingstock
due to her ignorance.

353
00:23:09,360 --> 00:23:11,320
She didn't dare manage
the household for years after.

354
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:14,680
Now that she insists on hitting a wall,

355
00:23:14,760 --> 00:23:16,360
it's the first branch that loses face.

356
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,560
It was unnecessary to stop her.

357
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,320
Indeed.

358
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:23,440
From the seating for
male and female guests,

359
00:23:23,520 --> 00:23:25,760
to the millet for
the Dowager Lady's charity porridge,

360
00:23:26,760 --> 00:23:28,520
and the taboos of each family in between,

361
00:23:28,600 --> 00:23:31,160
which of these can do without you?

362
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,840
Her humble mother-in-law

363
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:35,480
is a clear warning.

364
00:23:35,560 --> 00:23:36,880
Just watch.

365
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:38,760
Once she makes a huge fool of herself,

366
00:23:38,840 --> 00:23:41,200
she will surely come
begging you on her knees.

367
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,360
Oh, you.

368
00:23:46,520 --> 00:23:48,360
Resign to Grandmother immediately.

369
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:51,000
Just say you were young and foolish,
accepted recklessly, and now regret it.

370
00:23:51,560 --> 00:23:53,760
Having promised an elder,
how can I easily back out?

371
00:23:54,360 --> 00:23:56,400
You rashly accepted
such an important task.

372
00:23:56,480 --> 00:23:58,680
If done well,
Aunt gets credit for teaching you.

373
00:23:58,760 --> 00:23:59,720
If done poorly,

374
00:23:59,800 --> 00:24:01,560
it proves you are ignorant and unfit.

375
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:04,400
Under everyone's watchful eyes,

376
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:06,920
you will never recover.

377
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:08,360
Mother was like that because…

378
00:24:11,360 --> 00:24:13,720
If you won't go, I will speak for you.

379
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:15,440
Grandmother said

380
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:19,480
that whether it turns out well or not,
it shows my filial piety.

381
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:22,400
With Mother and Fourth Aunt guiding me,

382
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:23,600
and you helping me…

383
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:25,040
When did I say I would help you?

384
00:24:29,080 --> 00:24:30,720
I belong to the first branch.

385
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:33,680
Any honor or disgrace
belongs to the first branch.

386
00:24:35,920 --> 00:24:39,480
Could you bear to leave me helpless
and make a laughingstock?

387
00:24:44,880 --> 00:24:47,840
Please instruct everyone
that starting today,

388
00:24:47,920 --> 00:24:51,120
all staff in the first branch
are at my disposal.

389
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:55,240
You are audacious.

390
00:24:55,320 --> 00:24:56,160
And stubborn.

391
00:24:59,600 --> 00:25:02,160
My Lord, what is done is done.

392
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:04,000
It cannot be changed.

393
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:17,080
SONGYUE HALL

394
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,360
This is the arrangement

395
00:25:18,440 --> 00:25:19,800
for the hall and garden
on the banquet day.

396
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,280
Please review it, Young Lady.

397
00:25:21,360 --> 00:25:22,840
Young Lady,

398
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:26,040
the Dowager Lady wants to set up
a few extra tables in the garden

399
00:25:26,120 --> 00:25:28,480
to invite only
close clan members and in-laws.

400
00:25:28,560 --> 00:25:32,240
The Zhuo family sent word
that Old Madam Zhuo took a fall,

401
00:25:32,320 --> 00:25:34,760
has mobility issues,
and won't join the bustle.

402
00:25:34,840 --> 00:25:38,640
The Ren family apologized, saying Lord Ren
will soon take office in Qingzhou.

403
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:42,400
Their household is in chaos,
so not everyone can attend.

404
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:45,400
Some relatives complain of the distance
and ask for carriages to fetch them.

405
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:48,160
Others are elderly
and act too proud to come.

406
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:51,840
The Dowager Lady releases captive animals
for her birthday every year.

407
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:55,400
Besides fish and birds,
what else should be prepared?

408
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:59,400
- It's urgent. How can we not be anxious?
- We are so worried.

409
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:00,600
What should we do?

410
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:02,560
- How could we not worry?
- Indeed.

411
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,840
- What do we do now?
- What now?

412
00:26:07,520 --> 00:26:10,360
The region producing the Duke's favorite
<i>Qiulubai</i> liquor suffered a disaster.

413
00:26:10,440 --> 00:26:11,720
We can have <i>Lansheng, Zihong</i>
or <i>Huaying</i> liquors,

414
00:26:11,800 --> 00:26:12,720
which one should substitute for it?

415
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:14,880
Aunt, Rao invited you repeatedly.

416
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:17,200
She must want to show off her abilities.

417
00:26:17,280 --> 00:26:18,640
You should go in and take a look.

418
00:26:19,800 --> 00:26:20,760
First Madam has arrived.

419
00:26:20,840 --> 00:26:21,840
Let me talk first!

420
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:31,160
Mother,

421
00:26:32,760 --> 00:26:34,360
I have been waiting for you.

422
00:26:41,760 --> 00:26:44,520
Rao, we came to watch you
manage the household.

423
00:26:45,120 --> 00:26:48,160
Aunt has never been used
to scenes like this.

424
00:26:49,120 --> 00:26:50,960
It is better not to make her feel uneasy.

425
00:26:51,720 --> 00:26:54,360
Mother, I only married into
the Duke's Residence a few days ago.

426
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:55,320
How much experience could I have?

427
00:26:56,800 --> 00:26:59,120
I rely on you to decide for me.

428
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:01,880
By sitting here,
you give me your full support.

429
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:06,400
Make a list of the furnishings in the hall

430
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:08,960
and check it with Miss Qingtong
in the Dowager Lady's courtyard.

431
00:27:09,040 --> 00:27:11,280
Ask her directly about
anything to add, remove, or avoid.

432
00:27:11,360 --> 00:27:13,360
- Just ask her.
- Yes.

433
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:17,080
The Zhuo and Ren families are in-laws,
so as a junior, I cannot make decisions.

434
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:18,000
Tomorrow, at the Third Quarter
of the Hour of Mao,

435
00:27:18,080 --> 00:27:19,880
I will go to Wanxiang Hall

436
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:21,440
and report the replies from
both families to the Dowager Lady

437
00:27:21,520 --> 00:27:23,760
in front of my two aunts.

438
00:27:23,840 --> 00:27:26,120
List any other relatives
or in-laws who are not coming,

439
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:28,400
and I will report them to her together.

440
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,640
There is no need to trouble yourselves.

441
00:27:30,600 --> 00:27:31,520
Yes.

442
00:27:31,600 --> 00:27:35,280
As for spending money, tailoring clothes,

443
00:27:35,360 --> 00:27:37,160
raising birds, feeding fish,

444
00:27:37,240 --> 00:27:39,800
managing garden plants,
and handling food and drinks,

445
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:45,600
I thought you were
all experienced with your tasks

446
00:27:46,200 --> 00:27:48,600
and would keep
everything organized without mistakes.

447
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:51,640
I even planned to pick two capable ones

448
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:54,800
and report to the Dowager Lady
to promote them to head stewardesses.

449
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:56,480
I did not expect

450
00:27:57,040 --> 00:27:58,720
you all to be so incompetent.

451
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:01,760
Even the tiniest tasks
were brought to the one in charge.

452
00:28:02,280 --> 00:28:05,320
Either it was ill intent
or it was sheer incapacity.

453
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:07,840
If I used my overbearing temper from home,

454
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:10,240
I would dismiss you
without asking questions.

455
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:16,520
However, I have not been here long,

456
00:28:17,040 --> 00:28:19,000
so I do not know your character well yet.

457
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:22,920
I do not know who to replace
or who to promote.

458
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:25,320
So, please decide, Mother.

459
00:28:26,320 --> 00:28:27,520
Me?

460
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:28,920
Governess Miao.

461
00:28:29,760 --> 00:28:31,120
Do not worry, Madam.

462
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:34,280
My family has served
in this residence for three generations.

463
00:28:34,360 --> 00:28:37,560
I know characters and abilities
of the servants the best.

464
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:40,080
Whether loyal or treacherous,
honest or slick,

465
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:42,440
no one can hide from my eyes.

466
00:28:44,000 --> 00:28:47,080
Aunt, aren't you most afraid
of scenes like this?

467
00:28:47,160 --> 00:28:48,760
Why don't we…

468
00:28:48,840 --> 00:28:50,560
You are the mother of the heir

469
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:53,960
and the proper First Madam
of the Duke's Residence.

470
00:28:54,040 --> 00:28:56,000
Just sit here and take charge.

471
00:28:56,080 --> 00:28:57,280
Governess Miao will assign the tasks.

472
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,840
If anyone dares to delay their work,

473
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:02,880
feign compliance,
or deliberately cause trouble,

474
00:29:04,120 --> 00:29:06,000
just have Zhao Song
drag them out for a flogging.

475
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:10,640
Lord Lu said he cannot manage a household,
but he can lead an army.

476
00:29:11,160 --> 00:29:14,160
After twenty military
flogging strikes tear their flesh open,

477
00:29:14,240 --> 00:29:16,040
every single one of them will obey.

478
00:29:16,120 --> 00:29:19,280
- Well…
- Goodness…

479
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:21,960
Then, I will give it a try.

480
00:29:23,880 --> 00:29:27,000
Aunt, since my cousin has spoken,

481
00:29:27,680 --> 00:29:29,960
I will stay and help too.

482
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:34,720
Zhao Song, stay to assist.

483
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:38,040
Zhao Bai, follow me.
I have important orders.

484
00:29:39,280 --> 00:29:40,560
- Yes.
- Yes.

485
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:57,400
Bring them all forward.

486
00:29:59,320 --> 00:30:00,880
One by one.

487
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:08,960
Over here.

488
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:12,360
Is that it?

489
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:13,560
How many did you catch?

490
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:15,920
I've got more.

491
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:16,840
Over there.

492
00:30:18,040 --> 00:30:19,120
Don't let it get away.

493
00:30:21,840 --> 00:30:22,880
Gently.

494
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:25,360
I caught it.

495
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:29,600
After Lady Wei Rao fell into the water,
I sent people repeatedly to inquire.

496
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:31,240
Why didn't you reply to me?

497
00:30:31,320 --> 00:30:33,040
That night, the city guards
searched the market,

498
00:30:33,120 --> 00:30:34,400
finding no major robbers or villains,

499
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:36,280
though they did catch a few petty thieves.

500
00:30:37,280 --> 00:30:40,400
Did you confirm with Lady Wei Rao?

501
00:30:41,720 --> 00:30:43,200
What "Lady Wei Rao"?

502
00:30:43,720 --> 00:30:45,480
By etiquette,
you should call her sister-in-law.

503
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,600
Be gentle. They're all flying away.

504
00:30:55,360 --> 00:30:57,360
Right now, you should be busy with
the Dowager Lady's birthday banquet.

505
00:30:57,440 --> 00:31:00,040
Yet you have time
to catch butterflies here.

506
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:02,760
It was my fault
to suspect you without cause earlier.

507
00:31:03,280 --> 00:31:04,840
I hope you can forgive me, Lady Wei Rao.

508
00:31:05,720 --> 00:31:07,840
General Qi,
your mistakes are more than just one.

509
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,880
You scared away my butterfly.

510
00:31:15,840 --> 00:31:16,960
You got it?

511
00:31:19,480 --> 00:31:20,640
Thank you, My Lord.

512
00:31:23,480 --> 00:31:24,480
What are you doing?

513
00:31:25,200 --> 00:31:28,200
I specially caught some butterflies
to release at the birthday hall,

514
00:31:29,280 --> 00:31:31,120
letting them flutter around
the lamps and rest on flowers.

515
00:31:31,720 --> 00:31:34,600
We'll also prepare sweet melons
for them to perch on,

516
00:31:34,680 --> 00:31:39,120
wishing for a long line of descendants
and good fortune year after year.

517
00:31:39,200 --> 00:31:41,480
Lady Wei Rao, you really
know how to please people.

518
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:43,360
When the time comes, with flowers filling
the hall and butterflies fluttering,

519
00:31:43,440 --> 00:31:44,640
the Dowager Lady will be overjoyed.

520
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:48,600
Trying to steal the show at an elder's
birthday defeats the main purpose.

521
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:50,320
It's better to focus
on the practical work.

522
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:52,840
The garden is full of maids.

523
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:55,360
My Lord, do you only see me?

524
00:31:58,080 --> 00:31:59,480
When everyone wears flowers in their hair,

525
00:32:00,160 --> 00:32:02,840
a display of blooms is nothing special.

526
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:08,800
Instead, the one dressed most plainly
stands out the most among the women.

527
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:11,600
Following the same old routine
for the birthday banquet,

528
00:32:12,200 --> 00:32:13,960
no matter how proper the details are,

529
00:32:14,040 --> 00:32:15,480
it's just mediocre and error-free.

530
00:32:15,560 --> 00:32:18,400
If you want to win full applause
and make guests feel at home,

531
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:19,960
you need a little clever ingenuity

532
00:32:20,560 --> 00:32:22,280
and add more lively topics.

533
00:32:22,880 --> 00:32:24,440
Why don't you help me
catch a couple, My Lord?

534
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:27,720
Catch them yourself.

535
00:32:28,280 --> 00:32:29,160
I don't have time for this.

536
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:31,680
To show my apologies, I'll help you.

537
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:34,720
- You don't have time either.
- I do.

538
00:32:34,800 --> 00:32:36,080
- Jiede.
- Don't…

539
00:32:36,160 --> 00:32:37,240
- Send more servants to help.
- I'm free.

540
00:32:37,320 --> 00:32:40,120
- Yes.
- I really am free. Slow down.

541
00:32:40,200 --> 00:32:41,720
- So rough.
- Farewell, My Lord.

542
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:43,040
Ouch, that hurts.

543
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:54,080
Catch them quickly. A generous reward
for whoever catches the most.

544
00:32:54,160 --> 00:32:55,680
- Yes.
- Yes.

545
00:32:59,760 --> 00:33:01,880
Mother, when I arrived,

546
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:03,640
I saw my second brother
at the martial grounds.

547
00:33:03,720 --> 00:33:06,840
Over a dozen guards
were beaten to pieces by him.

548
00:33:06,920 --> 00:33:09,120
He will surely be
a fierce general in the future.

549
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:11,400
I see Grandfather
values him more and more,

550
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:13,640
even choosing
a new martial arts master for him.

551
00:33:13,720 --> 00:33:16,600
Though he says he treats everyone equally

552
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,760
and loves every grandson just the same,

553
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:22,160
deep down in his heart,

554
00:33:22,240 --> 00:33:23,360
it's crystal clear

555
00:33:23,440 --> 00:33:27,480
that only the eldest grandson
of the first branch is his favorite.

556
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:30,080
The rest are just afterthought extras.

557
00:33:35,640 --> 00:33:36,600
Mother, don't.

558
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:39,600
If you make this move, you will lose.

559
00:33:39,680 --> 00:33:41,440
Quiet while watching a game.

560
00:33:43,680 --> 00:33:44,760
Second Madam,

561
00:33:44,840 --> 00:33:46,160
Her Ladyship is leading
people from the first branch

562
00:33:46,240 --> 00:33:47,560
to catch butterflies everywhere,

563
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:48,920
saying it's for
the Dowager Lady's birthday.

564
00:33:50,480 --> 00:33:52,560
What an assertive Heir's Wife.

565
00:33:52,640 --> 00:33:56,520
She acts so wildly and recklessly.

566
00:33:56,600 --> 00:33:59,160
Who knows what scheme
she is plotting behind our backs?

567
00:33:59,240 --> 00:34:01,360
Mother, don't let her get too complacent.

568
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:03,760
She's too young after all.

569
00:34:03,840 --> 00:34:06,280
She's just eager to
establish authority and claim credit.

570
00:34:07,520 --> 00:34:08,920
What's your hurry?

571
00:34:09,520 --> 00:34:11,520
The rafter that sticks out rots first.

572
00:34:11,600 --> 00:34:12,800
Sooner or later,
she will learn her lesson.

573
00:34:21,560 --> 00:34:23,400
My Lady, you even know how to do this?

574
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:26,440
I learned it all
in the workshops in the past.

575
00:34:27,040 --> 00:34:29,080
Things I used to hate deeply.

576
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:33,480
<i>You wouldn't know</i>

577
00:34:34,239 --> 00:34:36,920
<i>I entered the lacquer workshop</i>
<i>as a hard laborer at five.</i>

578
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:40,280
<i>My whole body was covered</i>
<i>in sores from the raw lacquer fumes.</i>

579
00:34:40,360 --> 00:34:41,360
YOUNG A-CHOU

580
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:45,080
<i>At ten, I disguised as a boy</i>
<i>up in the hills to make charcoal.</i>

581
00:34:45,159 --> 00:34:46,000
Hurry up.

582
00:34:46,080 --> 00:34:48,520
<i>- A landslide almost killed me.</i>
- Don't dawdle.

583
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:49,760
Hurry!

584
00:34:50,639 --> 00:34:53,960
Keep up! Hurry up!

585
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:55,679
Get up.

586
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:58,920
Hurry up.

587
00:34:59,520 --> 00:35:01,240
<i>When the suffering became unbearable,</i>

588
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:03,560
I often dreamed

589
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:07,120
that my real parents were rich,

590
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:09,840
and that one day,

591
00:35:10,920 --> 00:35:12,640
they would rescue me from the abyss.

592
00:35:16,640 --> 00:35:17,640
Isn't it ridiculous?

593
00:35:20,360 --> 00:35:24,240
I often fantasized
that if I ever went back one day,

594
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:28,480
how I would win my elders' favor
and make a name for myself.

595
00:35:30,840 --> 00:35:32,320
Only later did I realize

596
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:37,200
that no one was coming.

597
00:35:38,320 --> 00:35:41,560
My pa was just a rogue gambler.

598
00:35:42,640 --> 00:35:44,480
My ma had tuberculosis.

599
00:35:44,560 --> 00:35:45,680
And I

600
00:35:46,720 --> 00:35:48,520
was born in the mire.

601
00:35:49,240 --> 00:35:50,560
If I didn't fight with all my strength,

602
00:35:53,520 --> 00:35:55,080
I will only sink further,

603
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,160
down to the very depths.

604
00:36:26,680 --> 00:36:28,200
Moths are not butterflies.

605
00:36:28,720 --> 00:36:30,320
They have no pretty patterns.

606
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:34,200
Yet their antennae
are like rigid riding whips.

607
00:36:35,680 --> 00:36:37,520
They are born to travel far.

608
00:36:38,120 --> 00:36:39,320
Indeed.

609
00:36:42,040 --> 00:36:43,360
At this gambling table,

610
00:36:45,040 --> 00:36:47,200
others have wealth
and family to help them.

611
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:49,560
I only have myself.

612
00:36:50,200 --> 00:36:51,920
So I will stake my life on it,

613
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:55,840
to see if I end up empty-handed

614
00:36:57,560 --> 00:36:59,640
or clean out the board.

615
00:37:00,960 --> 00:37:02,320
Invite Lord Lu for me.

616
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:05,240
My Lady, are you planning to…

617
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:08,480
Pardon my asking,

618
00:37:08,560 --> 00:37:10,360
but Lord Lu is
the very model of propriety,

619
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,960
following old rules in everything.

620
00:37:12,560 --> 00:37:15,920
Guanzhu said his routine and diet
haven't changed for years.

621
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:17,680
If even one new dish is added,
he has it sent back.

622
00:37:18,840 --> 00:37:22,120
He usually despises
novel or frivolous tricks.

623
00:37:22,200 --> 00:37:23,360
I doubt he'll agree.

624
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:25,200
You make a good point.

625
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:28,080
I should think of a way

626
00:37:29,880 --> 00:37:31,840
to leave him no choice but to agree.

627
00:37:55,600 --> 00:37:56,640
My Lord.

628
00:38:27,560 --> 00:38:29,040
Sorry for keeping you waiting, My Lord.

629
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:33,600
Stop once you've caught the butterflies.

630
00:38:34,120 --> 00:38:36,440
Disregarding convention for novelty

631
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:38,480
will lead to trouble sooner or later.

632
00:38:39,200 --> 00:38:42,640
I invited you here
because I heard Miss Qingtong say

633
00:38:42,720 --> 00:38:44,240
the Dowager Lady
often suffers from night terrors

634
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:45,160
and struggles to sleep soundly.

635
00:38:45,240 --> 00:38:46,920
I am aware of that.

636
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:49,920
After consultation,
the physicians said it wasn't an illness,

637
00:38:51,120 --> 00:38:52,640
just that as people age,

638
00:38:52,720 --> 00:38:54,800
they sleep lightly
and wake easily at night.

639
00:38:56,120 --> 00:38:58,760
I have something
that can help her sleep well,

640
00:38:59,760 --> 00:39:00,960
but I need your help, My Lord.

641
00:39:02,360 --> 00:39:03,480
What can you do?

642
00:39:06,200 --> 00:39:07,240
This way, please.

643
00:39:10,600 --> 00:39:11,960
No foolishness.

644
00:39:12,040 --> 00:39:13,240
I mean no offense.

645
00:39:14,160 --> 00:39:16,160
You'll understand once
you take a look, My Lord.

646
00:39:39,680 --> 00:39:40,560
It's drawing paper.

647
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:45,160
Look, add a top cover above,

648
00:39:45,240 --> 00:39:47,360
and sew the four sides with fishing line.

649
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:48,520
That makes a paper canopy.

650
00:39:49,360 --> 00:39:52,520
I thought of hanging lotus wall vases
at the four corners,

651
00:39:52,600 --> 00:39:54,440
accompanied by moonlight
and lotus fragrance,

652
00:39:54,520 --> 00:39:56,600
as if walking deep in a lotus pond.

653
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,680
Then, I thought

654
00:39:59,640 --> 00:40:02,640
this paper canopy was too plain and bleak.

655
00:40:03,320 --> 00:40:05,800
Though real flowers are lovely,
they don't bloom long,

656
00:40:06,320 --> 00:40:07,720
which might only make an elder feel sad.

657
00:40:08,720 --> 00:40:10,440
It would be better to paint them on.

658
00:40:11,120 --> 00:40:14,000
Actually, I preferred a silk canopy.

659
00:40:14,520 --> 00:40:18,280
On the sides, embroidering scriptures
in seal script shows sincerity.

660
00:40:19,360 --> 00:40:21,480
But my embroidery skills are poor.

661
00:40:21,560 --> 00:40:24,360
I can only embroider
two or three characters a day.

662
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:25,760
I couldn't make it
in time for the banquet.

663
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:31,760
The Dowager Lady loves
your paintings of flowers and birds,

664
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:34,840
so I asked for your help.

665
00:41:53,240 --> 00:41:56,200
Lotuses are fine flowers,
but they are just like you,

666
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:57,240
chillingly cold,

667
00:41:58,680 --> 00:42:00,080
lacking a touch of vitality.

668
00:42:00,840 --> 00:42:03,880
The decorations in
Wanxiang Hall are uniquely crafted,

669
00:42:04,680 --> 00:42:07,440
showing the Dowager Lady's
love for nature.

670
00:42:09,440 --> 00:42:10,920
In my view…

671
00:42:24,880 --> 00:42:27,720
A few strokes on the grass leaves
pictures a grasshopper.

672
00:42:30,040 --> 00:42:31,560
Dragonflies are dancing.

673
00:42:33,560 --> 00:42:35,000
That's a sign of vitality.

674
00:43:07,840 --> 00:43:08,680
Wei Rao,

675
00:43:09,680 --> 00:43:11,160
don't forget our agreement.

676
00:43:14,480 --> 00:43:15,680
I really regret

677
00:43:17,760 --> 00:43:19,440
making that one-year pact.

678
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:24,840
I want to be

679
00:43:28,160 --> 00:43:30,840
a true wife to you in every sense.

680
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:48,240
In your dreams.

681
00:43:49,280 --> 00:43:50,280
Careful.

682
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:52,800
Don't ruin my paper canopy.

683
00:43:54,000 --> 00:43:55,840
Even if you use
filial piety to pressure me,

684
00:43:56,440 --> 00:43:58,480
I will never
take a scheming woman as my wife.

685
00:44:00,920 --> 00:44:02,560
If you haven't tried,

686
00:44:06,920 --> 00:44:08,400
how do you know it's no good?

687
00:44:44,560 --> 00:44:46,440
What did you put in the incense burner?

688
00:44:48,280 --> 00:44:50,240
Just a little mood enhancer

689
00:44:55,160 --> 00:44:56,760
to add fragrance to the room.

690
00:44:58,320 --> 00:44:59,640
Do you like it?

691
00:45:14,680 --> 00:45:17,280
If you suspect I drugged it,
check it yourself.

692
00:45:18,080 --> 00:45:21,280
For a bit of calming incense,
you ruined my birthday gift.

693
00:45:23,400 --> 00:45:24,640
It's just a paper canopy.

694
00:45:25,720 --> 00:45:27,000
We can just make another one.

695
00:45:27,520 --> 00:45:29,920
All the large paper in
the storehouse is here.

696
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:32,320
Where do we find more on short notice?

697
00:45:33,520 --> 00:45:34,680
It is you who tease me so.

698
00:45:37,360 --> 00:45:39,200
To match this bed-curtain,

699
00:45:40,120 --> 00:45:42,280
I gathered bulrush fluff
everywhere for the mattress,

700
00:45:42,960 --> 00:45:46,120
steamed and dried it,
working day and night,

701
00:45:46,200 --> 00:45:49,480
and even coughed for
two nights from the floating fluff.

702
00:45:49,560 --> 00:45:51,840
Now the bed-curtain
is gone, all for nothing.

703
00:45:53,040 --> 00:45:54,760
I am an decent girl
of unsullied reputation.

704
00:45:55,880 --> 00:45:58,120
If the Dowager Lady hadn't begged me,

705
00:45:58,680 --> 00:46:01,800
hoping we'd make peace,
and sent servants to check in,

706
00:46:02,600 --> 00:46:07,000
why would I force myself on you
and get called shameless?

707
00:46:08,800 --> 00:46:11,720
We can find another birthday gift,
but promises must be kept.

708
00:46:12,880 --> 00:46:14,720
We agreed to be
a couple for just one year,

709
00:46:14,800 --> 00:46:16,120
and that won't change.

710
00:46:16,880 --> 00:46:18,480
Don't get your hopes up.

711
00:46:19,560 --> 00:46:20,640
Tonight, if it's Grandmother's wish…

712
00:46:23,640 --> 00:46:25,040
I won't blame you.

713
00:46:32,080 --> 00:46:33,160
Didn't you prepare other things?

714
00:46:33,920 --> 00:46:35,120
I'll have people make them for you.

715
00:46:39,880 --> 00:46:41,080
Ordinary craftsmen can't do it.

716
00:46:41,160 --> 00:46:43,040
I'll get the best palace artisans
to make them.

717
00:46:43,120 --> 00:46:44,920
I'm afraid it will cost too much,

718
00:46:45,560 --> 00:46:47,200
cause a stir, attract attention,

719
00:46:47,280 --> 00:46:49,280
and go against your principles.

720
00:46:50,760 --> 00:46:53,200
Before Grandmother's birthday,
I'll have them done and delivered.

721
00:47:17,120 --> 00:47:18,280
My Lord.

722
00:47:24,480 --> 00:47:27,600
‪LAMP BLUEPRINT

723
00:47:28,840 --> 00:47:32,360
So after all that effort,
this was your goal all along.

724
00:47:44,360 --> 00:47:46,920
Find the best craftsmen
and have it finished before the birthday.

725
00:47:48,560 --> 00:47:50,360
Delay by a single day,
and you will answer for it.

726
00:47:54,880 --> 00:47:56,120
What are you laughing at?

727
00:48:13,760 --> 00:48:14,920
Get out.

728
00:51:11,480 --> 00:51:13,880
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
